@startsalt
' Screen: User Notification Preferences
' User Stories:
'   - As a user, I want to control whether I receive freeball digest emails
'   - As a user, I want to set how frequently I receive digest emails
'   - As a user, I want to send a test email to verify delivery
'   - As a user, I want a clear path to unsubscribe from all emails

{
  ' Top nav
  {
    <b>codefre.sh</b> | Scripts | Runs | Review Queue | Settings
    .
    <i>Acme Engineering</i> | keith@noizu.com
  }
  ==
  ' Page header
  {
    <b>Notification Preferences</b>
    <i>Controls email notifications sent to keith@noizu.com.</i>
  }
  ==
  ' Digest settings
  {+
    <b>Freeball Review Digest</b>
    --
    [X] <b>Send me a freeball review digest email</b>
    <i>Summarizes pending freeballs assigned to you or unassigned in your org.</i>
    --
    <b>Digest Frequency:</b>
    (X) Daily   ( ) Weekly   ( ) Monthly
    --
    <b>Delivery time:</b>   ^08:00 AM^   <b>Timezone:</b>  ^America/Chicago (UTC-5)^
    <i>Digest is sent at the selected time on the chosen cadence.</i>
    --
    [Send Test Email Now]
    <color:green>Last test sent: 2026-05-11 08:03 UTC — Delivered</color>
  }
  ==
  ' Other notification toggles
  {+
    <b>Other Email Notifications</b>
    --
    [X] Freeball flagged for mandatory review (below low threshold)
    [X] Score dropped below org threshold on a run I triggered
    [ ] Member invited to my organization
    [ ] API token created or rotated
    [ ] SSO authentication failure detected
    [ ] Weekly org activity summary
    --
    <i>Critical security alerts (e.g., break-glass login) cannot be disabled.</i>
  }
  ==
  ' Save + unsubscribe
  {
    [Save Preferences]
    --
    ..
    <i>To stop all non-critical emails: </i> [Unsubscribe from All Emails]
    <i>Unsubscribing will disable all digest and event emails. You can re-enable anytime.</i>
  }
}

@endsalt
